{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CffQVCSopgro41QVVjDcj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**The Ledger of Small Changes**\n\nBefore the first commit, there is only dust,\na folder full of maybes on the disk,\nand then you type `git init` because you must,\nand suddenly the nothing has a risk.\n\nYou stage your hopes with `add`, line by line,\nyou choose which edits earn a place in time,\nand `commit` seals them with a hashed design,\na forty-character, unbreaking rhyme.\n\nEach snapshot points back to the one before,\na chain of parents stretching into night,\nso nothing that you wrote is lost for sure,\nthough some of it you'd rather hide from sight.\n\nYou branch to dream without disturbing main,\na side road where the risky work can roam,\nand when it's ready, merge it back again,\nor let it wither quietly, far from home.\n\nThen conflicts come, those angle-bracket wars,\nwhere HEAD and theirs both swear that they are right;\nyou stand between, the judge of tangled scores,\nand choose a truth, and so resolve the fight.\n\nThe log remembers what your memory won't:\n\"fix add,\" you wrote at midnight with a sigh,\n\"add subtract\" next, as if to say, \"I don't\nregret the math; I only wonder why.\"\n\nAnd `blame` will name the hand behind each line,\nand `bisect` hunts the moment things went wrong,\nwhile `stash` keeps half-done thoughts in quiet brine\nuntil you're brave enough to sing their song.\n\n`rebase` rewrites the story you would tell,\nand `push --force` erases what the others knew.\nUse them with care, for history, as well\nas code, belongs to more than only you.\n\nSo commit small, and write your message clear,\nand push before the laptop meets the floor;\nthe past is safe, the future's always near,\nand every HEAD awaits one commit more."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4037,"cache_read_input_tokens":12183,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4037},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"61fc3b9c-5705-4d88-aa88-a223d23c9c1b","uuid":"a938f4b9-6487-4ff6-9c4b-9873716a0bcc","timestamp":"2026-10-03T13:46:15.932Z","request_id":"req_011CffQVC4VKtyAXgkPhrz3F"}
